# Generated experiment outputs.
# Existing tracked files stay tracked. New large outputs are ignored; small,
# stable reports are allow-listed below (curated copies belong in results/).
data/generated/*
!data/generated/*_report.md
!data/generated/*_aurac_curve.csv
# Compact OOF predictions / metrics / metadata for the dispersion experiments
!data/generated/*_oof.csv
!data/generated/*_oof_predictions.csv
!data/generated/post_token_dispersion_predictive_evaluation.*
!data/generated/predictor_vs_post_token_dispersion_*.csv
!data/generated/predictor_vs_post_token_dispersion_results.json
!data/generated/*_post_token_hidden_state_metadata.json
generation_log.txt
semantic_uncertainty_repo/

